## The German texts of the messages the demo's actions return. They reach
## the tables through `DemoWeb.CoreComponents.translate_error/1`, which
## `config :ash_table, translate_error: …` names.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: de\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);\n"

## Ash: a string shorter than its `min_length`
msgid "length must be greater than or equal to %{min}"
msgstr "muss mindestens %{min} Zeichen lang sein"

## Ash: a string longer than its `max_length`
msgid "length must be less than or equal to %{max}"
msgstr "darf höchstens %{max} Zeichen lang sein"

## Ash: a number above its `max`, below its `min`
msgid "must be less than or equal to %{max}"
msgstr "darf höchstens %{max} sein"

msgid "must be greater than or equal to %{min}"
msgstr "muss mindestens %{min} sein"

## Ash: a required attribute left empty
msgid "is required"
msgstr "muss ausgefüllt werden"

## Ash: a value that is not one of the attribute's type
msgid "is invalid"
msgstr "ist ungültig"

## Demo.Tracker.Task: the validation of `status` against `progress`
msgid "must be 100 when the task is done"
msgstr "muss 100 sein, wenn die Aufgabe erledigt ist"
